 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "A past fact remembered",
   "texto": [
    "**-았/었던** presenta una acción o experiencia como pasada y delimitada, vista desde el presente: 가다 → **갔던 곳** (el lugar al que fui), 좋다 → **좋았던 날** (el día que fue bueno), 만나다 → **만났던 친구** (el amigo que conocí). It does not necessarily mean that the situation cannot be repeated."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Variance with - - - and - (-)",
   "texto": [
    "**-던** usually highlights the memory of something usual, whether in progress or not presented as finished. **-았/었던** usually presents the action as completed. The context can make them overlap; it does not reduce to «no longer exists». **먹은 음식** is a more neutral past form."
   ]
  },
